# TeiaCarePrometheus Changelog

## [0.1.2] - 2026-10-15
### Fixed
- One Conan recipe revision per release: version.cpp is generated in the build directory instead of the source tree
- No CRLF conversion on Windows checkouts (the Windows jobs exported a different recipe)
- Remove the stale generated src/version.cpp from the repository
### Changed
- CD deploys only on v* tags and uploads only teiacare_prometheus_client/<version>, never "*"
- CI resolves third-party Conan 2 packages from teiacare_conan2; teiacare serves only teiacare_*

## [0.1.1] - 2026-04-21
### Changed
- Migrate build toolchain to Conan 2 and venvpp2
- Point scripts submodule to TeiaCare/venvpp2
- Bump Windows MSVC profile to compiler.version=194
### Fixed
- MSVC C4458 variable shadowing in histogram and summary tests
- Remove empty `requires` to fix `conan create` in Conan 2
